{"url":"http://127.0.0.1:18900/long.html","final_url":"http://127.0.0.1:18900/long.html","html_content":"<!doctype html><html><head><title>Long article</title></head><body><article><h1>Long form</h1>\n<p>Paragraph one is long enough to matter, describing the fixture, its purpose, and the fact that it exists only to exercise extraction. No real host is named.</p>\n<p>Paragraph two continues the thought, adding detail so the recall guard has a meaningful baseline to compare the primary extractor against.</p>\n<p>Paragraph three closes the sample, and remains synthetic.</p></article></body></html>\n","text_content":"Long form\nParagraph one is long enough to matter, describing the fixture, its purpose, and the fact that it exists only to exercise extraction. No real host is named.\nParagraph two continues the thought, adding detail so the recall guard has a meaningful baseline to compare the primary extractor against.\nParagraph three closes the sample, and remains synthetic.","markdown_content":"# Long form\n\nParagraph one is long enough to matter, describing the fixture, its purpose, and the fact that it exists only to exercise extraction. No real host is named.\n\nParagraph two continues the thought, adding detail so the recall guard has a meaningful baseline to compare the primary extractor against.\n\nParagraph three closes the sample, and remains synthetic.","title":"Long article","metadata":{"status_code":200,"final_url":"http://127.0.0.1:18900/long.html"},"structured_data":{},"extracted_data":null,"links":[],"images":[],"screenshot_base64":null,"status":"completed","error":null,"scraper_used":"HttpxScraper","processing_time_seconds":0.005175113677978516,"storage_state":null}